{"articleNo":"106448","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=106448&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2014 여름방학 교육기부 프로그램 북 및 포스터 디자인 공모전 참가 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2014.05.15","hit":"5272","attachments":[{"name":"여름방학 교육기부 프로그램 북.포스터 디자인공모.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=106448&attachNo=3859"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<ol style=\"LIST-STYLE-TYPE: upper-alpha\"><li style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">교육부와 한국과학창의재단은 '꿈과 끼를 키워주는 행복교육'을 기업, 대학, 공공기관 등의 사회자원을 공교육에 활용하는 교육기부 활성화를 추진하고자 2014학년도 여름방학 교육기부 프로그램 북 및 포스터 디자인 공모전을 아래와 같이 개최하오니 많은 참여 바랍니다. </span></li></ol><ol style=\"LIST-STYLE-TYPE: upper-roman\"></ol><p style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">- </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">아 &nbsp;래 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">-</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">가</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">공모목적 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림체; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">여름방학 교육기부를 상징하는 프로그램 북 표지 및 포스</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 터</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">&nbsp;디자인</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 한양신명조\">공모를 통해 수혜자들에게 교육기부 인식을 제고하고 교육기부 참여를 독려</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.2; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-RIGHT: 5pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><